    <div class="q"><span class="n">6</span><span>Whether signs, permits, staffing, legal authority, and funding can be ready by July concerns <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="feasibility" data-hint="Choose whether implementation is realistically possible." data-fix="Implementation capacity concerns feasibility.">choose</button>.</span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">7</span><span>Examining whether one vehicle rule creates different barriers for mobility-service users is an <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="equity" data-hint="Evaluate how barriers and access are distributed without assuming one final policy answer." data-fix="Distribution of access barriers is an equity question.">choose</button> analysis.</span></div>
