    <div class="q"><span class="n">1</span><span>Tutor contrasts <span class="ex">POLitics, poLITical</span>, and <span class="ex">POLicy</span>. The line demonstrates <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="different stress in politics, political, and policy" data-hint="Listen for first, second, and first-syllable prominence." data-fix="Politics, political, and policy have different stress patterns.">listen</button>.</span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">2</span><span>Tutor contrasts <span class="ex">GOVernment</span> with <span class="ex">governMENtal</span>. The change demonstrates <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="a stress shift in the government family" data-hint="The main stress moves in the longer adjective." data-fix="The government family shifts stress in governmental.">listen</button>.</span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>Tutor contrasts <span class="ex">LEGislate</span> with <span class="ex">legisLAtion</span>. The line demonstrates <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="a stress shift from legislate to legislation" data-hint="Hear the verb's first-syllable stress and the noun's later stress." data-fix="Stress shifts from LEGISLATE to legisLATION.">listen</button>.</span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">4</span><span>Tutor reads: <span class="ex">“According to the CONsultation, / respondents raised ACCESS concerns.”</span> The source frame introduces <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="an attributed access concern" data-hint="The speaker identifies who supplied the evidence before stating the concern." data-fix="The line attributes the access concern to consultation respondents.">listen</button>.</span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">5</span><span>Tutor reduces both instances of <span class="ex">and</span> while keeping the nouns clear. The line compares <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="paired rights, duties, costs, and benefits" data-hint="Recover the two coordinated public-value pairs." data-fix="The line pairs rights with duties and costs with benefits.">listen</button>.</span></div>
